# Who may publish and subscribe where on Rho's broker (docs/broker.md). One user per role; nobody anonymous.
# scripts/broker-auth.sh on copies this to /opt/homebrew/etc/mosquitto/peak.acl. A publish outside these lines is
# dropped by the broker without an error to the client, so a new topic needs a line here first.

# the mind, health and the hand scripts (npm run trick / device / pub): everything under peak/
user mind
topic readwrite peak/#

# hearing, vision, presence: events out, the readings and events they listen to, their own status
user senses
topic write peak/+/event
topic read peak/+/event
topic read peak/+/sense
topic readwrite peak/mind/+/status

# the voice: every say on a body's cmd, its own status, and the speaking flag for half-duplex hearing
user voice
topic read peak/+/cmd
topic readwrite peak/mind/voice/status
topic readwrite peak/mind/speaking

# the body on the Pi: its commands in, its readings and presence out, the mind's status for the dead-man switch
user mech
topic read peak/mech/cmd
topic write peak/mech/sense
topic readwrite peak/mech/status
topic read peak/mind/+/status

# the desk light's ESP32-C6 (ESPHome): its own subtree
user desk-light
topic readwrite peak/desk-light/#

# the owner's own mosquitto_sub / mosquitto_pub (~/.config/mosquitto_sub and _pub hold the login)
user owner
topic readwrite peak/#
topic read $SYS/#
